{"sourceUrl":"https://www5.zzu.edu.cn/mkszy/info/1048/7242.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:07.145576+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www5.zzu.edu.cn/mkszy/info/1048/7242.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span>  郑州大学马克思主义学院</span><span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span>接收推荐免试攻读硕士研究生预报名材料</span><span><span>工作即将开始，现将有关事项通知如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>一、</span></strong><strong><span>提交</span></strong><strong><span>预报名材料</span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>凡已取得或预计可取得所在本科毕业学校推荐免试资格的应届本科毕业生</span></span><span>，</span><span>请</span><span><span>将下列材料</span></span><span>按照</span><span>1-</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>的顺序统一扫描整合到一个</span>PDF<span>文件，文件统一命名为：报考专业</span><span>-</span><span>姓名</span><span>-</span><span>联系电话，</span></span><span>并</span><span><span>于</span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span></span><span><span>17</span></span><span><span>日之前统一发送到邮箱</span></span><span>：</span><span>zdmyyjsgz@163.com</span><span><span>，发送邮件主题为</span><span>“姓名</span><span>+</span><span>推免生预报名材料”。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>《</span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年郑州大学推免预报名申请表》（要求签字完整）（模板见附件）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>身</span></span><span><span>份证正反面、学生证复印件以及相关具有推免资格证明材料</span></span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>本科前六个学期成绩单（须加盖学校教务部门公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>所在专业综合成绩排名证明（须加盖学校教务部门公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>5</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>外语水平证明（大学英语四级、六级考试，托福，雅思，</span>PETS<span>等证书或成绩单）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>6</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>已发表的学术论文、见刊文章、获奖证书、参与的科研项目或其他能够证明个人能力的材料（没有可不提供）</span></span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span><span>7.</span><span>学籍在线报告。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>二、招生与面试工作安排</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>拟接收推免生的专业：马克思主义基本原理</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>马克思主义中国化研究</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>思想政治教育</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>中国近现代史基本问题研究</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>党的建设</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>科学技术哲学</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>中共党史</span></span><span>。</span><span>最终招生专业以研招网推免系统公布专业目录为准。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>面试时间：按照中国研究生招生信息网系统报名时间确定。具体安排会在</span>QQ<span>群通知（群号：</span></span><span><span>748302482</span></span><span><span>，申请进群请备注：报考专业</span>+<span>姓名</span></span><span><span>，进群后改备注为</span><span>“报考专业</span><span>+</span><span>姓名</span><span>+</span><span>联系电话”</span></span><span><span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>面试方式：</span></span><span><span>我院将成立研究生招生面试专家小组，</span></span><span><span>采用线上面试方式。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span>面试内容</span><span>：</span><span><span>满分</span>100<span>分，具体内容包括：（</span><span>1</span><span>）专业素质和能力：大学阶段学习情况及成绩、全面考核考生对本学科（专业）理论知识和应用技能掌握程度，利用所学理论发现、分析和解决问题的能力，对本学科发展动态的了解以及在本专业领域发展的潜力、外语听说能力、创新精神和创新能力。（</span><span>2</span><span>）综合素质和能力：思想政治素质和道德品质等、本学科（专业）以外的学习、科研、社会实践（学生工作、社团活动、志愿服务等）或实际工作表现等方面的情况、事业心、责任感、纪律性（遵纪守法）、协作性和心理健康情况、人文素养、举止、表达和礼仪等。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.</span><span>拟招收推免生人数以学校最终下达指标为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>三</span></strong><strong><span>、公示</span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>根据面试成绩分专业从高到低排名，在</span></span><span><span>马克思主义</span></span><span><span>学院官方网站进行公示</span></span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>四</span></strong><strong><span>、</span></strong><strong><span>联系</span></strong><strong><span>方式</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>咨询</span><span><span>电话：</span>0371-6778</span><span>1339</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>五</span></strong><strong><span>、其他事项</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>全国推免服务系统（预计</span>9<span>月中下旬）开放后，已具有推免资格的考生，</span></span><span><span>还须按照教育部及我校规定的时间内在</span><span>“全国推免服务系统”中填报我校志愿，完成国家规定的推免生录取工作流程，否则申请无效。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>申请人必须保证所提交申请材料的真实性和准确性。若申请人提交的信息不真实或不准确，不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>郑州大学</span></span><span><span>马克思主义</span></span><span><span>学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"53092ed47e56dc216012839a7c5c0b6b68de553ef05cd6b919316e2b68c8d29a","textLength":1158,"sourceSha256":"e2d4294c96b0a2b3e5ffd6b9c1f756113284980faf1e945e6f58cf757ad046b3","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件2027年郑州大学推免预报名申请表.doc","url":"https://www5.zzu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1329668099&wbfileid=18186020"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d62598e6ac275b4f7b60","title":"2026年郑州大学马克思主义学院2027年接收推荐免试攻读硕士研究生预报名材料的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:07.145576+00:00"}
